graph TB
    subgraph "llm-d-latency-predictor"
        subgraph "Training Server (Port 8000)"
            TrainingAPI[Training API<br/>FastAPI/Uvicorn]
            ModelTrainer[Model Trainer<br/>XGBoost + LightGBM]
            ModelStore[Model Store<br/>PVC: training-models-pvc]
            TrainingAPI -->|trains| ModelTrainer
            ModelTrainer -->|persists| ModelStore
        end

        subgraph "Prediction Server (Port 8001)"
            PredictionAPI[Prediction API<br/>FastAPI/Uvicorn]
            ModelSyncer[ModelSyncer Thread<br/>Periodic HTTP Pull]
            LocalCache[Local Model Cache<br/>emptyDir Volume]
            ModelSyncer -->|downloads & validates| LocalCache
            PredictionAPI -->|loads models from| LocalCache
        end
    end

    Client[External Client] -->|POST /predict<br/>POST /predict/bulk| PredictionAPI
    TelemetrySource[Telemetry Source] -->|POST /add_training_data_bulk| TrainingAPI

    ModelSyncer -->|GET /model/name/info<br/>GET /model/name/download| TrainingAPI

    PredictionSvc[prediction-service<br/>LoadBalancer :80] -->|routes to :8001| PredictionAPI
    TrainingSvc[training-service<br/>ClusterIP :8000] -->|routes to :8000| TrainingAPI
    TrainingSvcExt[training-service-external<br/>LoadBalancer :8080] -->|routes to :8000| TrainingAPI

    K8s[Kubernetes] -->|liveness /healthz<br/>readiness /readyz| PredictionAPI
    K8s -->|liveness /healthz<br/>readiness /readyz| TrainingAPI

    style TrainingAPI fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style PredictionAPI fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ModelTrainer fill:#7ed321,color:#fff
    style ModelSyncer fill:#7ed321,color:#fff
    style ModelStore fill:#f5a623,color:#fff
    style LocalCache fill:#f5a623,color:#fff
    style PredictionSvc fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style TrainingSvc fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style TrainingSvcExt fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style Client fill:#f9f9f9,stroke:#999
    style TelemetrySource fill:#f9f9f9,stroke:#999
    style K8s fill:#326ce5,color:#fff
